'Endpoint lower bound and the LC unit check','Length_F(γ)≥F(γ(T)−γ(0)),with equality for the constant-speed straight segment. Forℓ=0.2andc=7.5×10^(−10),ω₀≈81649.658rad/sandf₀≈12994.947Hz.',
