'TakeF(v)=max(|v₁|/a,|v₂|/b),with displacement(a,b).',
'The straight length isone. A path first moving by(a,0)and then(0,b)has lengthtwo,not less thanone. Multiplying the entire functional byκscales both values byκand cannot reverse their ordering. The recovered5800Hzdrive divided by the natural frequency is about0.446327,but this ratio alone does not determine a nonlinear path action.',
'The geometric incompatibility is exact,and the elementary oscillator units are independently reproducible.',
'This does not rule out drift-dependent or position-dependent actions,which can prefer nonstraight paths. Their additional terms must be specified before fitting numerical calibration targets.',
'Given the actual three paths and action density,compute their integrals symbolically or with certified bounds,and test whether the claimed endpoint and norm assumptions are truly shared.',
